  "body": "We noticed today that this section:\n\nhttps://url.spec.whatwg.org/#hosts-%28domains-and-ip-addresses%29\n\nContradicts the URL spec parsing a bit.  The RFC for domains does not allow characters like `&`, but the URL spec parsing does allow it.\n\nSo section 3 should probably be marked non-normative.\n",
